        <p class="mt-4">justify-content-space-between / space-around / space-evenly : la différence se voit aux bords</p>
        <div class="demo-frame d-flex justify-content-space-between mt-2"><div class="demo-box p-2">un</div><div class="demo-box p-2">deux</div><div class="demo-box p-2">trois</div></div>
        <div class="demo-frame d-flex justify-content-space-around mt-2"><div class="demo-box p-2">un</div><div class="demo-box p-2">deux</div><div class="demo-box p-2">trois</div></div>
        <div class="demo-frame d-flex justify-content-space-evenly mt-2"><div class="demo-box p-2">un</div><div class="demo-box p-2">deux</div><div class="demo-box p-2">trois</div></div>
        <p class="mt-4">align-items-start / center / end / baseline / stretch (le premier bloc est plus haut)</p>
        <div class="demo-frame d-flex align-items-start gap-2 mt-2"><div class="demo-box p-6">haut</div><div class="demo-box p-2">start</div></div>
        <div class="demo-frame d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mt-2"><div class="demo-box p-6">haut</div><div class="demo-box p-2">center</div></div>
